// QuikView Windows resource script -- only job: embed the app icon into the PE.
//
// Why embedded: Explorer / taskbar pin / file associations / shortcut default
// icons all read RT_GROUP_ICON from the exe. Before this file existed the repo
// had no .rc at all, so ExtractIconW returned 0 and every shortcut was blank.
//
// windres resolves the ICON path relative to its working directory, which is not
// necessarily resources/, so CMakeLists passes --include-dir=<src>/resources.
// (Keep this file ASCII-only: windres is picky about encodings.)

IDI_ICON1 ICON "quikview.ico"
